"opt_in_description" = "Here at Snap, we’re working to make our products more inclusive. You can help us by joining our Made For Me Program. If you join:\n\n • You may get early access to test Snapchat products or features\n • We may recommend products we think you’ll like\n • We’ll ask some questions about you and your experience using Snapchat \n\nWe will use your responses to help identify what product engagement data to study and to improve our products to make Snapchat more fair and inclusive. For example, your responses may help us identify how people with certain physical characteristics interact with a specific feature, such as a Lens, so we can work on making it more inclusive. We’ll keep your responses as long as we’re conducting our inclusivity research, or until you decide to opt-out. You can easily opt-out by deselecting the button in the top right corner. You can also change your answers at any time, in which case we’ll delete your previous responses. \n\nIf you change your mind and want to continue to help make our products more inclusive, you can rejoin the panel at any time by opting-in at the top right corner.";
